      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added a choice for ELAN80 series read modes in Kconfig. As I understand, users can select the mode via prj.conf or Kconfig.defconfig. I’m a bit unclear how this interacts with a “sensor-specific config” that might select a mode—could you clarify?",
      "parentUuid": "d1501101_e1dd2f39",
